ata-tex=\"\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar}),V,\\succ,\\pi\">\\(\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar}),V,\\succ,\\pi\\)</span>；假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StrictOrder}(F,\\succ)\">\\(\\mathrm{StrictOrder}(F,\\succ)\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WF}(F,\\succ)\">\\(\\mathrm{WF}(F,\\succ)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RedOrd}_{\\Sigma,V}(&gt;_{\\mathrm{lpo}}^{\\Sigma,V,\\succ,\\pi})\n\\land\\mathrm{WF}(T,&gt;_{\\mathrm{lpo}}^{\\Sigma,V,\\succ,\\pi}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{RedOrd}_{\\Sigma,V}(&gt;_{\\mathrm{lpo}}^{\\Sigma,V,\\succ,\\pi})\n\\land\\mathrm{WF}(T,&gt;_{\\mathrm{lpo}}^{\\Sigma,V,\\succ,\\pi}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是 Theorem 6.4.3 对全部字典序 status 的实例，名称对应 Definition 6.4.4；由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"415b9e19f223c427\" href=\"?note=415b9e19f223c427\" title=\"56-thm-rpo-well-founded\">56-thm-rpo-well-founded</a> 直接推出。已读原书对应 RPO 证明，并核对 status 实例化。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>, Cambridge University Press, 2003；6.4.3–6.4.4; 6.4.26，印刷页 211; 221–222。<code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 是本地 DjVu 文本层提取块序号，不是已确认的物理扫描页号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-lexicographic-path-order","status":"resolved","id":"6e0ceb35e6a34f4f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-lexicographic-path-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-rpo-well-founded","status":"resolved","id":"415b9e19f223c427","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 